  "prefLabel": "Ins 1304.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1304.02 Applicability. This part shall apply to all licensed resident individual producers with property and casualty line of authority whether or not they have attempted to place, have placed, or intend to place flood insurance through the National Flood Insurance Program (NFIP).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ins 1300) #8934, eff 8-1-07; ss by #10862, eff 8-1-15; ss by #13546, eff 1-31-23",
